# ERROR EXAMPLE: Missing closing * for coordinate block
# ORCA requires a closing * after the last atom coordinate in the xyz block
# Without it, the input parser encounters an unexpected end-of-file
# ORCA error: "Unexpected end of file" or input parsing error
# Fix: Add closing * after the last atom line
! B3LYP 6-31G(d) Opt Freq pal16

%maxcore 6000

* xyz 0 1
O      0.000000    0.000000    0.117300
H      0.000000    0.756950   -0.469200
H      0.000000   -0.756950   -0.469200